{"time": 1756113910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125522099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那么要放弃这个地方吗？可以去东边看看。”"}
{"time": 1756113986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194217102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“刚才在广场我只看到了鸽子使魔，没见到其他人。”"}
{"time": 1756114093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479649773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“那就是我的使魔。”多看一眼小黑，“你不会起了什么坏心思吧？不过刚刚那只使魔也被毁掉了”"}
{"time": 1756114144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180457070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没有…姐姐大人让我赶紧过来帮你们解围。”"}
{"time": 1756114170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118287624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这个地方是几级灵脉？”"}
{"time": 1756114268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905985973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“5级..”摇摇头叹了口气“哎，可惜....不过我也不想继续和那家伙耗下去了”"}
