{"time": 1756388108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118539731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“姐姐你不是金毛吗？”"}
{"time": 1756388177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108968723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“哎呀，我看错了。不必在意”她眨了眨眼"}
{"time": 1756388236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130031228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“两位姐姐来这里，是受欺负了？还是有问题想问呀？”"}
{"time": 1756388266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1141932884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是到了这边，总觉得不来看看不行。\""}
{"time": 1756388383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227196863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“啊呀，谢谢关心~不过我刚忙完，一会还要接着忙~哎，到了晚上就更忙了，你说，我好苦的命是不是？”"}
{"time": 1756388447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1602891258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那你要不要吃点心？”"}
{"time": 1756388462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "7858541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"既然决定举办这样的故事，那...忙一些也正常对不对?\"指着沙发，\"我们能坐吗？\""}
{"time": 1756388473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "175494021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*把怀里剩的点心分一个给她"}
{"time": 1756388560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401827382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（你还有？）"}
{"time": 1756388649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "978622790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“喔，谢谢你~”*她接过你的点心，不知道从哪里摸出一个苹果糖还给你“当然当然~虽然这里是我的休息室，但是随便坐~”"}
{"time": 1756388718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063480846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*接过苹果糖开吃"}
{"time": 1756388757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804316673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 你有什么要问的？）"}
{"time": 1756388997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547329631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯..我们姑且也算是在等人。正好也可以在这里听听花火大人发发牢骚。\""}
{"time": 1756389097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433754857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"听外面的姐姐说，她惹了花火大人生气，嗯...怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1756389257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494929254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“嗯……虽然很听话，但是她编的故事有点……让人读不下去”*她戳着下巴想了想"}
{"time": 1756389574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754055230", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你是举办者吗？那你知道圣杯好不好吃吗？”"}
{"time": 1756389586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2097132072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“姐姐你是举办者吗？那你知道圣杯好不好吃吗？”"}
{"time": 1756389589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467108150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦...那还真是...\"靠着椅子，\"花火大人有什么建议吗？\""}
{"time": 1756389682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1158090490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2097132072]“真是好问题~我没吃过，如果你做到了可以和我分享一下感受~”"}
{"time": 1756389725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205058740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“建议？”她眨眨眼“我不会给那种东西啦，非要说的话……扮演好自己？”"}
{"time": 1756389787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312138543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*点点头"}
{"time": 1756389803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "551938694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我会分享吃圣杯的感觉的。”"}
{"time": 1756389884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119856400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（没活我就）"}
{"time": 1756389893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569855262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（让虚幻国王来了）"}
{"time": 1756389907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293452842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...那我就不知道啦。\"看了看，\"话说，\"我如果在这里，建了阵地，花火大人会帮忙看着吗？\""}
{"time": 1756390010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019012189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“嘟嘟——”她比了个❌“我不会参与这种东西”"}
{"time": 1756390047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486366260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我没活了）"}
{"time": 1756390055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1925664912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...那万一对方毁掉了这边，花火大人岂不是没地方去了?\"歪歪头"}
{"time": 1756390125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144407148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“这里……不会打起来的。不论哪边都一样~”"}
{"time": 1756390166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960882773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"太好啦。\"拍拍手，\"那我就在这里建立阵地。\"点头，\"谢谢花火大人。\""}
{"time": 1756390233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117281919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（不过只拆阵地不攻击你本人的话）"}
