{"time": 1756731979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018357439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“姐姐你啥时候回来的，感觉好几天没看到你。”"}
{"time": 1756732079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943018140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=214053259]（好难回答）"}
{"time": 1756732081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703515767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"确实，不过我失败啦。彻彻底底的。\"一边开口，一边通过留在占卜屋的使魔对二阶堂小姐说话，\"万神庙这边搞不定啦。\""}
{"time": 1756732394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1481222787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=214053259]“小孩子不要看12+的内容啦……但是无聊又不分年龄”花火不知道从哪里给你掏出一瓶苏乐打“那就躲着等看好戏上演嘛”"}
{"time": 1756732773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461533639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"弄得我好像大明星诶，走到哪里都被针对。\"无语地看了一眼内外的连接门，\"无聊诶，无聊。\"感知一下那个过来的使魔，\"之前花火大人也见过吧?\""}
{"time": 1756732784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720580663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那我们还要去天文台看看吗？”"}
{"time": 1756732882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818381082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057651114", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那个使魔啦。\"回头看小黑，\"要去的吧？留在这里也没什么意义。\""}
